{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1355730-amatha\u2019s-plan-campaign-brainstorming","id":1355730,"title":"Amatha\u2019s Plan (Campaign brainstorming)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-18T17:49:06-08:00","id":1355730,"title":"Amatha\u2019s Plan (Campaign brainstorming)","content":"So I\u2019ve been thinking about a Solar/Lunar campaign based around the idea that one of the best ways to beat the Realm is... to support it in its Civil War. (Ie give them enough rope to hang themselves)<br /> <br /> Now I\u2019m not 100% up to date with my Realm politics, but would it be feasible for a faction of the Silver pact (say Amatha Kinslayer\u2019s) to totally destabilize the balance of power by supporting, say House Peleps (the one her daughter is in) from the shadows until every DB is pointed at every other DB and the Realm is totally engulfed in civil war?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","user":"prototype00","date":". 12-18-2019, 09:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-19T00:27:31-08:00","id":1355787,"title":"","content":"As far as 3rd edition lore is concerned Amatha's daughter should actually be part of House Cynis, her husband being Dragon-Blooded doesn't override the matrilineal descent system anymore.<br /> <br /> Unless there was no record of the birth and her husband convinced a female relative of his to say they were the mother, so that if she somehow escaped and ran back to House Cynis he could keep the child and gaslight her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-19T00:50:10-08:00","id":1355788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1355730-amatha\u2019s-plan-campaign-brainstorming?p=1355787#post1355787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As far as 3rd edition lore is concerned Amatha's daughter should actually be part of House Cynis, her husband being Dragon-Blooded doesn't override the matrilineal descent system anymore.<br /> <br /> Unless there was no record of the birth and her husband convinced a female relative of his to say they were the mother, so that if she somehow escaped and ran back to House Cynis he could keep the child and gaslight her.</div> </div> </div> </div>I must confess, this is not something I know for sure, lol. <br /> <br /> Option 1. Is the legal path, but the hubby was a douchebag and his family seemed to back him up so maybe unfortunate chicanery occurred a la option 2? (He did basically imprison Amatha in a Peleps country estate)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-19T02:12:46-08:00","id":1355804,"title":"","content":"I guess the important question is what you want from Amatha as an NPC. The more you involve her personal history the more the PCs need to care about her backstory.<br /> <br /> A daughter who was absorbed into House Peleps makes her goal of seeing Cynis fall first much simpler and easier to reconcile with her lingering emotional attachments but maybe she's going to have to show the PCs why she's called Kinslayer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 12-19-2019, 06:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}